@startuml
title UML - immutable Core periodic basis and calculation evidence
hide methods
class PeriodicPolicy <<Core published PREVIEW_ONLY>> {
 id / productVersionId / digest
 exact finite UTC calendar
 daily ACT365 or whole-month fixed fee
}
class BasisCapture <<Core immutable>> {
 id / original actor / client / key
 capturedPersonId / coreAsOf UTC
 accountId / registeredAt / state / restrictions
 exact productVersionId / policyDigest
 periodStart inclusive / periodEnd exclusive
 dueAt : frozen calendar UTC
 status : OPEN_PROVISIONAL or CLOSED_OBSERVATION
 currentBooked / held / available : i64 strings
 opening / change / observedClosing : i128 strings
 sourceCount : 0..1000
 sourceDigest / artifactDigest : SHA256
}
class NativeSourceItem <<immutable saved membership>> {
 ordinal : 1..1000
 batchId / operationId / originalBatchId?
 postingKind / businessDate / postedAt UTC
 journalFingerprint : native SHA256
 deltaMinor : signed i64 string
}
class JournalBatch <<Core native immutable fact>> {
 id / operationId / businessDate
 entries : balanced actual account legs
 fingerprint / postedAt
}
class BasisCalculation <<derived preview only>> {
 amount : exact Money
 exactNumerator / denominator : decimal strings
 evaluatedAt : saved coreAsOf
 isDue / provisional
 basisSource : CORE_BUSINESS_DATE_BASIS_V1
}
class AuditEvent <<stable recovery>> {
 id : basis UUID
 person / occurredAt : original capture
 action : finance.periodic-basis.captured
}
class AuditCursor <<Finance recovery>> {
 lastId : persisted UUID
 page : 50; wraps past failures
}
BasisCapture "*" --> "1" PeriodicPolicy : frozen exact policy
BasisCapture "1" *-- "0..1000" NativeSourceItem : business date before exclusive end
NativeSourceItem "*" --> "1" JournalBatch : independently verified saved native facts
BasisCapture "1" --> "0..1" BasisCalculation : no clamp / no current-balance fallback
BasisCapture "1" --> "1" AuditEvent : idempotent original identity and time
AuditCursor --> AuditEvent : repair lost acknowledgment
note bottom of BasisCapture
One statement snapshot includes account position and prefix facts.
Historical totals never use the current balance as an opening substitute.
New facts require a new artifact; closed observation is not finalization.
Account registration is not customer enrollment or consent evidence.
end note
@enduml
